  "description": "LanderLab is a landing page builder for marketers, media buyers, and agencies. This connector lets Claude work inside your LanderLab account, so you can build and manage landing pages by describing what you want.\n\nWhat you can do:\n\nCreate new landing pages from templates, or import an existing page by URL\nEdit page content, upload assets, and publish to your own domains\nRun A/B tests: clone variants, set traffic splits, and compare performance\nView leads and analytics across workspaces, pages, and variants\nConnect 60+ integrations for lead delivery, pixels, and tracking\nBuild automation workflows that react to new leads",
